  "nativeDispositions": [
    "Four editable exact-string fields; no numeric coercion or Enter submission. Wrong values clear, correct values persist, wrong outcome precedes empty.",
    "Wrong hint is retained verbatim despite square-style wording on a cubic exercise.",
    "Coach sprite55 is stopped and never called; only source85 and correct-feedback57 are active clocks.",
    "Input/Output headers change to x/y over216-222. Four substitutions replace one another in one native panel. Terminal474 stops.",
    "Outlined title, grid and dialog artwork mapped to native text/table/dialog. Shape21 is an underline helper; failed shape raster export is preserved."
  ],
